      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I need your advice for the Nebula board meeting tomorrow. We need to hit that $1.2B valuation or the whole deal is dead. How should we talk about our IP portfolio and how strong our patents are? I want to make sure they feel totally confident in our tech stack.",
