      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should be completely honest about the challenge immediately to avoid a trust breach, framing it as a \"known risk\" rather than a \"future disaster.\" Demonstrate a concrete mitigation strategy, such as an active counter-claim or an alternative licensing plan, to show you have the pain under control. This transparency will actually strengthen your case by proving you are not hiding liabilities, preventing them from using the patent as a hidden threat to negotiate a lower price.",
